suffrage-cause                suffrage

; === nationality (proper adjectives - the realize layer title-cases) =========
; The single-word ones already capitalise correctly from the canonical hstr;
; st-revieran needs an explicit two-word form (capitalise_first only touches the
; first letter, so the second word is pre-capitalised here).
st-revieran                   St Revieran

