; === kinship, as a question names it ===========================================
; "relations" means a man's relationships - mother, spouse, sibling - never the
; structural root kind [k relation] the singular rules would make of it; the .pl
; form is what the parse reads, the unmarked one what realize says.
relationship                  relationship
relationship.pl               relations
